" =========================
" VsVim configuration
" =========================

" --- Line numbers ---
set number
set relativenumber

" --- Scroll half-page and center cursor ---
nnoremap <C-d> <C-d>zz
nnoremap <C-u> <C-u>zz
inoremap kj <Esc>

set scrolloff=5
set sidescrolloff=5
set nowrap
